# SITE FLAT BAR at the building site in SoMa: an ollie onto the flat bar and a 50-50 to its end. (The
# squeezed city re-homes the site to an empty lot on Potrero del Sol's east side, built mirrored and
# turned; the lot slopes 8 degrees and the bar follows it, 0.32 m over the lot at both ends; the start
# comes in from the west to the bar's middle and the grind runs south to its end.)
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 1 teleport 642.20 -255.05 -12.75 140.0
cmd 3 set skater.vel.x 2.571
cmd 3 set skater.vel.y -3.064
hold ollie 78..108
tap grind 120..178 every 4
bot balance
run 600
expect event grindStart{trick=FS 50-50,line=rail_644_-260} within 119..123
expect event grindEnd{reason=end} within 191..195
expect event gap{id=site_bar_soma,gap=SITE FLAT BAR,points=250} within 191..195
expect event land{quality=clean} within 240..244
expect event comboLanded{name=FS 50-50 + SITE FLAT BAR} within 251..255
expect no event bail
